  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "3 tablespoons white sugar",
    "3 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking soda",
    "0.75 teaspoon salt",
    "3 cups buttermilk",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "3 eggs",
    "0.33333334326744 cup butter, melted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, sugar, baking powder, baking soda, and salt in a large bowl. Beat buttermilk, milk, eggs, and melted butter together in a separate bowl. Keep the two mixtures separate until you are ready to cook.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6oBrQpMhhq1oJBNgk6FT5lZX-0U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24530-ButtermilkPancakesII-mfs-Step1-3324-4x3-31495484543045ef9c0ffb0749bff6d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24530/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a lightly oiled griddle or frying pan over medium-high heat. You can flick water across the surface and if it beads up and sizzles, it's ready.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the wet mixture into the dry mixture; use a wooden spoon or fork to mix until it's just blended together. The batter will be a little lumpy which is what you want.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/74WMt3HZwqk7OzTWE713ZJsm92o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24530-ButtermilkPancakesII-mfs-Step3-3344-4x3-f0acb995fb9b49b09eaf2fe4c250eebe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24530/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour or scoop batter onto the preheated griddle, using approximately 1/2 cup for each pancake. Cook until bubbles appear on the surface, 1 to 2 minutes; flip with a spatula and cook until browned on the other side. Repeat with remaining batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uNcJZg-t1UvLMdzgGT4GCkgzB60=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24530-ButtermilkPancakesII-mfs-Step4-3351-4x3-4ac4e6c043844ec48db0cb204aaf15a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24530/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
